      "comment": "STAR ZIPPER (8) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (22.38) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including six wins. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Must come into calculations. SUDDEN SURPRISE (1) ran good time (16.20) winning a Grade 4/5 three back at The Gardens but missed the frame latest finishing fourth at The Gardens. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. REBORN SPARK (4) was out of in the placings when fourth last time but three runs back posted a fast 22.23 win over 388m at this track. Should be in this for a long way. BIGBAD ESME (6) is last start winner who looks one of the chances.",
